# Top level: only the project's own files. Programs compiled by hand, the
# executables they produce and notes left at the top level stay local;
# the project lives in the folders below.
/*
!/*/
!/.gitignore
!/Cargo.toml
!/Cargo.lock
!/LICENSE
!/README.md
!/ARCHITECTURE.md
!/CONTRIBUTING.md
!/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md
!/stress_test_comprehensive.rs

# Build output
/target/
**/*.rlib
**/*.rmeta

# What the compiler writes next to an executable
*.s
*.o
*.a

# Python bytecode from the test scripts
__pycache__/

# The v1.2 battery stays local
/tests_v1_2/

# Of tests/, only the test harness is part of the project: the rest are
# tests of the earlier pipeline, kept locally until it is removed
/tests/*
!/tests/conformance.rs
!/tests/driver.rs
!/tests/cli.rs
!/tests/scratch.rs

# Editors and operating systems
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
